## What this does

Takes a ticket as the single source of truth for a change, and turns it into working code
plus tests — without expanding past what the ticket actually asks for. The point of routing
through a ticket instead of a freeform description is that the ticket is the contract: if
it doesn't say something, that's a signal to ask, not to guess.

